  "notes": "Measured on JA826J (left, SFO, 2026-04-19), fitted to the 787-8 shape within 3 px; the fin's dashes read off a 3x zoom of the same photo, each segment's corners mapped through the fit. The fin reads a pale grey beside the white body in every photo seen (light, or a grey paint: official: false). The wordmark is a title (ZIPAIR's logo is its name); the tail's dashes are drawn as areas. Small registration and 'Boeing 787' lettering not drawn.",
  "history": "New file (ZIPAIR had no scheme here). Its only scheme, since the airline's first flights in 2020."
